# Pure-Python drivers for native filesystem/source-delivery component controls.
# These tests use the explicit compiled native helpers, not the installed SDK.
# Full SDK/privacy gates retain python/iroha_python/requirements-ci.lock.
# Regenerate with Python 3.12 and pip-tools 7.6.2:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --resolver=backtracking --strip-extras \
#     --output-file ci/requirements-native-components.lock \
#     ci/requirements-native-components.in
# Include pytest's pure-Python Windows console dependency on every host so the
# same resolved lock is complete on Linux, macOS, and Windows.
